      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `extract_layout.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external provider for layout extraction. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task as it provides robust document analysis capabilities, including layout extraction. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Textract. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862924068,
          "start": 1789862921910
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc24c6b600124MX3O90A8li68",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc24c21a001I6267gzTgvb3FI",
      "session_id": "ses_f43db3e01ffe7E68JtPtdIYZeg",
